  "prefLabel": "Pda 306.04 Updating of Certain Information Provided on Application Forms Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 306.04 Updating of Certain Information Provided on Application Forms Required. In order to maintain updated contact and business information with the division, any person appointed as a pilot under Pda 305.01 shall notify the division in writing, within 30 days of the change, of any changes to information provided on an application form under Pda 306.01(b)(4)-(10), Pda 306.02(b)(4)-(10), and Pda 306.03(b)(4)-(10).\n\nSource. #9891-A, eff 4-1-11; ss by #12760, eff 4-19-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pda100-700.html"
